@K53_REMOVE_CONTRACEPTION
;After having had at least one child, Tewi will refuse all forms of contraception.
IF CFLAG:53:子供人数 > 0 && !FLAG:70 && CFLAG:MASTER:イタズラ != 2 && !TCVAR:無理矢理 && EXISTVAR("nChildrenPresent")
	IF CFLAG:53:出産経過日 < CHILD_就学 || (CFLAG:53:妊娠経過日数 <= 30 && TALENT:53:妊娠) || (CFLAG:53:妊娠経過日数 > 70 && TALENT:53:妊娠)
		IF !VAR_OR_DEFAULT("FLAG:STABLEBYPASS") && !(TALENT:HYPERFERTILE)
			RETURN 0
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
	LOCAL = 0
	IF TEQUIP:MASTER:コンドーム
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"안 돼! 거절이야! 우리는 그거 안 해! 나 줄래! 날것으로 해줘! 나는 \@ PREGNANCY_MULTIPLES(53) ? 아기들 # 한 아이를 원해 \@! 난 그런 것들이 싫어! 무효화야! 거부! 뭐 하는 거야?!")%」
		PRINTFORMDL %SPLIT_G(@"Before you can put it on:Before you realize it:While you're trying to put it on:With a lightning-fast motion")%, 테위(Tewi) %SPLIT_G(@"snatches the condom out of your hand:steals the condom:rips the condom off your dick:swipes the condom out of your hand")%와 %SPLIT_G(@"tosses it aside:discards it:throws it away:rips it apart with her teeth:chucks it over her shoulder:flings it away:pitches it far away")%이다.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"그런 건 필요 없어 %UNICODE(0x2764)%:넌 그걸 필요로 하지 않을 거야 %UNICODE(0x2764)%:그건 잊어버려 %UNICODE(0x2764)%:왜 더 기분 나쁘게 만들어? %UNICODE(0x2764)%:그냥 넣어 %UNICODE(0x2764)%:어차피 너한테 좋을 리가 없잖아, 그렇지? %UNICODE(0x2764)%:이봐, 왜 그래?")%」
		TEQUIP:MASTER:コンドーム = 0
		LOCAL = 1
	ENDIF
	IF TCVAR:53:ピル
		PRINTFORMDL 테위 %SPLIT_G(@"turns her head to one side:faces aside:tilts her head aside:lunges her head aside")%와 %SPLIT_G(@"spits something out:spits something from her mouth:spits something small in an arc")%는...
		PRINTFORMDL 그것은 경구 피임약이다. %SPLIT_G(@"looks like:appears to be:looks an awful lot like:resembles:looks to be")%%SPLIT_G(@"She grins at you when you notice:Her eyes twinkle with mischief:She sticks her tongue out with a mischievous expression:She wiggles her body and smirks at you")%.
		TCVAR:53:ピル = 0
		LOCAL = 1
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN LOCAL

@K53_3P(ARG)
;Threesome initiation lines, to be called in other dialogues.
